<li>Doctor of Science, Hiroshima University, 1994-1994 (Riset di Yukawa Institute for Theoretical Physics, Kyoto University, Japan).</li>
<li>Master of Science, Hiroshima University, 1989-1991 (Riset di Research Institute for Theoretical Physics, Hiroshima University, Japan)</li>
<li>Magister Sains, Institut Teknologi Bandung, 1986-1988</li>
<li>Sarjana, Institut Teknologi Bandung, 1980-1985</li>
</ul>
<h2>Penghargaan</h2>
